+insensitive filesystem before evaluating it, so this module simulates that
+too: paths that differ only by case or Unicode normalization are merged (the
+first name seen is kept, the last file's contents win), and the same inputs
+that made packignore fail (including hard links and unreadable files, which
+its upload couldn't send) raise PackignoreError here.
